        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a trafficker, the balances of deceit are in his hand: he loveth to oppress. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Ephraim said, Surely I am become rich, I have found me wealth: in all my labors they shall find in me no iniquity that were sin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But I am Jehovah thy God from the land of Egypt; I will yet again make thee to dwell in tents, as in the days of the solemn feast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have also spoken unto the prophets, and I have multiplied visions; and by the ministry of the prophets have I used similitudes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Is Gilead iniquity? they are altogether false; in Gilgal they sacrifice bullocks; yea, their altars are as heaps in the furrows of the field. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob fled into the field of Aram, and Israel served for a wife, and for a wife he kept ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And by a prophet Jehovah brought Israel up out of Egypt, and by a prophet was he preserved. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim hath provoked to anger most bitterly: therefore shall his blood be left upon him, and his reproach shall his Lord return unto him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
